{"id":31024715511495,"type":"artist","name":"Lisa Germano","artist":null,"year":1958,"weight":16,"info":{"tags":["singer-songwriter","female vocalists","dream pop","indie","alternative"],"country":"US","begin":"1958-06-27","kind":"Person","similar":["Stina Nordenstam","Kristin Hersh","Liz Phair","His Name Is Alive","Mercury Rev","Juliana Hatfield","PJ Harvey","Cat Power","Throwing Muses","Red House Painters"],"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Lisa-Germano.jpg?width=500","bio":"Sus directos son una experiencia turbadora. Con voz, guitarra y piano la estadounidense crea una liturgia íntima de folk-pop y desgrana piezas de una belleza trágica estremecedora. El repertorio de esta ex colaboradora de David Bowie y John Mellencamp fluye como el opus de un Jeff Buckley femenino.\n\nwww.lisagermano.com"},"works":[{"id":53809413245582,"type":"album","name":"On The Way Down From Moon Palace","artist":"Lisa Germano","year":1991,"weight":6,"yt":"TsoYcxKuIFQ","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":280004426209948,"type":"album","name":"On The Way Down From The Moon Palace","artist":"Lisa Germano","year":1991,"weight":6,"yt":"TsoYcxKuIFQ","src":"charts,musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":13018320481353,"name":"Scaruffi 1990s","rank":85,"scaruffi":8.0}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":8101631725648,"type":"album","name":"Happiness","artist":"Lisa Germano","year":1993,"weight":13,"yt":"qjZ6xfdv0WA","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":13018320481353,"name":"Scaruffi 1990s","rank":256,"scaruffi":7.5},{"id":242989188719526,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Dream Pop","rank":123,"scaruffi":7.5}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":132123986701169,"type":"album","name":"Geek The Girl","artist":"Lisa Germano","year":1994,"weight":20,"yt":"rY0