"genre","name":"Pop Rock","n":1},{"id":8412226417108,"type":"genre","name":"Indie Rock","n":1}],"labels":[],"album_labels":[],"own_scenes":[],"scenes":[{"id":198167102636761,"name":"Cantautoras de los noventa","book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","start":1989,"end":2003,"desc":"Las mujeres tienen sus propios estilos, en plural: Azalia Snail y su psicodelia lo-fi, Jarboe, Lida Husik (entre la cantante pop y la pintora sonora), Robin Holcomb, Lisa Germano (Geek The Girl, «un viaje dantesco a la psique de una chica»), Tori Amos, Juliana Hatfield, Kristin Hersh, Jewel, Natalie Merchant, Cat Power (Moon Pix), Edith Frost, Lauryn Hill, Shannon Wright. Las «grrrls» más airadas: Lois Maffeo, Ani DiFranco, PJ Harvey (Dry, Rid Of Me), Liz Phair (Exile In Guyville), DQE, Aimee Mann, Sheryl Crow, Alanis Morissette, Neko Case. Y los paisajes sonoros de Björk, la cantautora más influyente de la década, Kate St John, Natacha Atlas, Heather Duby, Solex y Beth Orton.","color":"#a3e635","family":"Folk y cantautores","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#women-90s"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":53809413245582,"artist":"Lisa Germano","artist_id":31024715511495,"title":"On The Way Down From Moon Palace","year":1991,"ess":0,"yt":"TsoYcxKuIFQ","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Cantautoras de los noventa","scene_id":198167102636761,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#women-90s","chapters":["Sección 6.6"],"pages":[[1,251,null]]},{"id":8101631725648,"artist":"Lisa Germano","artist_id":31024715511495,"title":"Happiness","year":1993,"ess":0,"yt":"qjZ6xfdv0WA","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Cantautoras de los noventa","scene_id":198167102636761,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#women-90s","chap