worked like the exhausting grief of a lengthy funeral. In the process, Germano reenacted Nico's most lugubrious nightmares as well as Leonard Cohen's saddest fables. Her songs had become pure existential shivers. Excerpts From…"},{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":252,"text":"…saw the light at the end of the tunnel, although the scene was still unfocused. Leaving behind the claustrophobic excesses of the previous albums, Germano entered a less creepy landscape. Rather than soliloquies, these songs sounded like dialogues between her touching voice and her ghostly violin. But…"},{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":328,"text":"…？ Kurt Cobain of Nirvana commits suicide ？ Independent labels founded in 1994 include: Rather Interesting ？ Other significant albums of the year: Lisa Germano's Geek The Girl, Nine Inch Nails's The Downward Spiral, Magnetic Fields's The Charm Of The Highway Strip, Aurora's Dimension Gate, Von Lmo's Cosmic…"}],"podcast":[],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":280004426209948,"type":"album","name":"On The Way Down From The Moon Palace","work_year":1991,"list_id":13018320481353,"list":"Scaruffi 1990s","src":"charts","rank":85,"year":1991,"note":null,"yt":"TsoYcxKuIFQ","scaruffi":8.0},{"id":8101631725648,"type":"album","name":"Happiness","list_id":242989188719526,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Dream Pop","src":"musthear","rank":123,"year":1993,"note":null,"yt":"qjZ6xfdv0WA","scaruffi":7.5},{"id":8101631725648,"type":"album","name":"Happiness","work_year":1993,"list_id":13018320481353,"list":"Scaruffi 1990s","src":"charts","rank":256,"year":1993,"note":null,"yt":"qjZ6xfdv0WA","scaruffi":7.5},{"id":132123986701169,"type":"album","name":"Geek The Girl","list_id":118267099057662,"list":"AOTY Must Hear 1990s","src":"musthear","rank":258,"year":1994,"note":null,"yt":"rY0vJHgWCDg","scaruffi":9.0},{"id":132123986701169,"type":"album","name":"Geek The Girl","list_id":